#: scenario8:scenario8_79B311FB_7D6D_4461_ABCC_6EEC3B8E85DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fa84fb9de439a88b29b231c2b4fb165d237fcf7fe9cc19231ba27e4b556939a
#. default-sha256: 591508ac80c7250f5747fb9bcdf76fdfef7fbded6256ff97f7b03c41e8c56caa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79B311FB_7D6D_4461_ABCC_6EEC3B8E85DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was picturesque."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫한 폭의 그림 같은 나날이었어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36080deb0cad5f542c76c7380a07f04dc7d14e084f22ef00cf8b16862692e54a
#. default-sha256: 1f07010233f863d5b26ac1a51c8697c6d8cfc8bc249348757e206a3aa82007b3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And you were always there with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그리고 그래, 내 옆에는 늘 네가 있었던가."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC2B4A05_1531_4721_B9A6_AB21828E1C77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ebeeed1b0cfe36ca82cbbb858a21f241154fbedd174bb48a9778f02f35a7c94
#. default-sha256: 6b76e9662b824079be106cd5b3ce3f6d63a23d41de91ef81629cb817aa42dfc5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DC2B4A05_1531_4721_B9A6_AB21828E1C77"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫평생 이어질 줄 알았어."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫평생 이어질 줄 알았어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5728d5be9d881d282c67c0d6d1285e4aeee33184f15045a316c06e7f70799db
#. default-sha256: 8711475797b2bd740031096a555ba1a7de4be572e2b874b71b8063899ef07451
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Following my seventeenth birthday, though, I was met with a deluge of changes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫17세 생일이 지나자, ⟪k:2⟫내 주변 환경은 급변했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4103186b4dec2035d81180d3b2050a7b0b54489c713944b9131ce95a598359e0
#. default-sha256: 394598bcb18200c75044e4df576e643dbf8b42facadf02870554a0b3c6727eff
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First, Father fell ill... ⟪k:1⟫and passed away shortly thereafter...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With his death "
"came the question of who would be the next head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫먼저 아버지가 쓰러져서…… ⟪k:1⟫그대로 불귀의 객이 되었고……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫친족들은 후계자를 누구로 "
"할지 의논하기 시작했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30e3035f3585e7f42154e8f1d9e20f6692a83460e9b2eefa85d90b67cba30c09
#. default-sha256: 1f090221fbbfb42bd7283634303a9c16dda19d99e452aa3c6de7128ad351b72c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was seventeen, by all means enough of an adult to handle things myself. ⟪k:1⟫Or, well, "
"that’s what I thought, anyway."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 이미 17세라서 ⟪k:1⟫충분히 성인으로 활동할 나이였어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫적어도 내 생각은 그랬는데――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd017a2cb1af6895e2671c28997a90e94a66be11db9343690dd6857445c70957
#. default-sha256: 9b9e39823e3b98b78df0a80528d584e7d05a51b4ee2df7ca3a338ec17d6bdcaf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a small house, far from home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his way of making it hard for me to come back. "
"⟪k:3⟫Not that I had any intention of returning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 쉽게 못 돌아오게 하고 싶었을걸.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐, ⟪k:3⟫나도 돌아갈 생각이야 없었지만서도……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22e44c26bc51a1c4f71a4d743dc9e4f4448393b166f7acf674f91b0a17b1554b
#. default-sha256: 67166ec5d64e1b019a6675d34a6a92cb560c023dbf1247ac1dc2d39c323dbc9e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was you coming with me, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리, ⟪k:1⟫네가 ⟪k:2⟫나를 따라와 준 거였어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc93af3231364046038a6cc5ff35ac031cfdc7de893e7e47d8110ec32e8d307d
#. default-sha256: beff9b81e6fb08b077e3eb457b61d6dc39a4ee418767ba0995023b478ce8f7ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……뭐, ⟪k:4⟫그렇지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6532f522ce939c88a96e8d39665c72c3f5701062fd5beef7616cf5bc3693b65d
#. default-sha256: cc0e97adfde09d5d56699b26591fcd52c70def5fdf2edd16f78178dce6b024a1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫진짜로…… ⟪k:1⟫아무것도 없는걸. ⟪k:2⟫넓은 정원, ⟪k:3⟫그림 한 장, ⟪k:4⟫꽃꽂이할 꽃병, ⟪k:5⟫은접"
"시 위 과일도 없어――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5e91f2c188308e1e94054c59ac04829e58e6c1520ecded7aea8372b747f7f24
#. default-sha256: c125ca84f3bfe800d82c02aecf85f3c9194a062b084703ae709dc14ec8cccbc8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫넬리도 오라버니를 위해 힘낼게.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저기 오라버니, ⟪k:4⟫배고프진 않아?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bc1c199f8144b78f1054fcd65436027f3c782316af4ea2602dd9e183cf4a6a9
#. default-sha256: 20b35f0dcd3f220e38bdda12be1f5a144c265082c77831a9f41b1cc2df168aa4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫yeah... ⟪k:5⟫a bit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아, ⟪k:3⟫응……, ⟪k:4⟫조금 고프네……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a950dcff3498e278e848fa6d0f121b0dee464bc0f071034ac7995b3d8307e75f
#. default-sha256: 340025017060d0f812a79f13927c49cd38f8358ee9141a72cc19b673a0ecd87c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:3⟫You’ve got quite the sweet tooth.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You’re going to make "
"yourself sick like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아하하……, ⟪k:3⟫과자만 있잖아.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그러다가 ⟪k:6⟫얼마 못 가서 몸이 탈날라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4c1e261588cba9c35eedd930bf1944629492c95739e54484e5c741a4f8d0395
#. default-sha256: 05a4502251c6486c0ac43909c63d47f37910fd1d2c5aa75bb07f92c2fdc30203
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nope. You’ve been frowny all day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아니, ⟪k:2⟫아까까지 ⟪k:3⟫엄청 힘들어 보이는 표정이었어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6bdc8cb97b24f77a90f93ac4a45d22b389e811d136aa4e1b99ce88a9f6bf05d
#. default-sha256: 964614066f3214a2ace8aa05af63341b8eed71c50695166cac94a54407003375
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whatever you say..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……그랬나……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0129a5fb31af0e48964178e538bd649aac91721bec2d53d0c889ef0970c3b3c5
#. default-sha256: 6a23c8f8c295423075d7a4142c1fee97ee710d8706cdeb83b57dca3560ff625a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Forget about all that stuff at home.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We’ve got each other! We can do this!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫집안 문제는 ⟪k:2⟫아무렴 어때.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫함께 있으면 뭐든 힘낼 수 있을 거야!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b966e61e680e352f1672917c9d197ce23ad87370b2219ba1fc9605f5095a7857
#. default-sha256: c72dd1993a1f53cbd074b14562f88781e21ab30f382bae961d032a87c506bbb8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’ll all work out, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll always be here for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫괜찮아, ⟪k:2⟫오라버니.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫넬리는 평생 ⟪k:5⟫오라버니 곁에 있을게."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93f785283ee8d5185c17eee11de9e6d2f878b95ffc9dfc1ec14b379b76f20df7
#. default-sha256: 7c6bd0e65df70e53307371dae5f99b89d47d682623511500b80a534413f41a15
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suppose so..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그렇지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ebe3a9baf48872c4abbadd84be471c00cb8d379e6fbe33eb3cb41829cf5f3ef
#. default-sha256: bdfe615eeaf2c441f39b441f7e75b18593d1b15897827676f62859675e609b2f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My whole life had changed so abruptly, so dramatically,⟪k:1⟫that my mind just wasn’t able to "
"keep up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫일해야 한단 건 알았는데, ⟪k:1⟫갑자기 확 바뀐 생활에 ⟪k:2⟫내 마음이 못 따라갔어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cec315970df1f2988ac4fe1970cdc6e264779b4ec44576262fcfd28487309e02
#. default-sha256: df9a92c8d72a20ac15554d2f6054e86fefebf7e3c3f048ac2119bb4020436259
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our new life together was quiet and unremarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫둘이서 사는 생활은 ⟪k:1⟫아무것도 없는 평화로운 나날이었어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb8ba066d01614b391a1fe2c94209d93d3ded518a461980620441e7b750fb845
#. default-sha256: 10c3642124b995cf8c66021169af25c8a8722e09fb93ab44457cb96b57366663
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was... ⟪k:3⟫planning on using it for supper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아니, ⟪k:3⟫요리하려고."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDE67F71_752F_46B9_B0BF_974E59FB2505
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b02a1039b12973bc272e07becdd4c981119d7e41cb90f49f8dd1217f4a012f64
#. default-sha256: cefd5906a92e6d4f21fc8b41ef4d845c4a7871e9877fbc1c076b02c72292b0e2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DDE67F71_752F_46B9_B0BF_974E59FB2505"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Y-⟪k:2⟫Yes, but..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그, ⟪k:2⟫그렇긴 한데~……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_73427DE4_86F4_4374_BF45_C20454200F78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5940e6f6e1b66e10dd7fdf506517af1ef8937884a8f052fda4e3f854bfe1d85b
#. default-sha256: 5b6fc4bd6e0cb8d8594aca9230dabf7380c3e5a6f91cf4d9d6be68ba53ef95f0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_73427DE4_86F4_4374_BF45_C20454200F78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uhh, ⟪k:3⟫if I remember... ⟪k:4⟫the guy said you have to pluck its feathers, then "
"cut off its head and drain all the blood..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫으음, ⟪k:3⟫듣기론 ⟪k:4⟫깃털을 뜯은 후…… 목을 치고 ⟪k:5⟫피를 뽑는다던데――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BA468D70_3326_41B2_B93D_17BDBE2EAD12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5db33b2ab5a458357f14c42979021401d0470ee29f676e00a65f5a09603e310f
