"⟪k:0⟫and that we didn’t have to be anything “more” for her to be the most important person in the "
"world to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 비록 남매라도――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내가 넬리를 변함없이 가장 소중히 여긴단 걸……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_526AABF0_B814_490E_84E0_A5B7CD9AB3D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54ac7315ea32f86870b58f7c4dc8ac4013738e3c48d7db6d3379f0b447e7241d
#. default-sha256: feed8b20c53debc6e0910a38fd8aaba177f2b7f9bfefcd38737a8ff716f11f76
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_526AABF0_B814_490E_84E0_A5B7CD9AB3D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie woke up one day with a high fever that refused to break. ⟪k:1⟫At first, I thought it "
"was just a cold and that she’d be over it soon enough,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫넬리가 고열이 났는데, ⟪k:1⟫그게 좀처럼 가시질 않았고……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫처음엔 그냥 감기인가 했지만, "
"⟪k:4⟫점점 악화됐어……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_97CE0C15_BBB1_48F1_966B_F633997388E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e762e4c33e0d4b14f94f3dabdc18999a3ecede5b6073543ab4a4121d2d61b42
#. default-sha256: 32e87baa935a012a87deb3a6b137b0e51c1c7c4ec33ed91284440abcc344a974
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_97CE0C15_BBB1_48F1_966B_F633997388E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but as much as I tried to convince myself, “Oh, she’ll be better tomorrow,” she just kept "
"getting worse, until eventually, she couldn’t even get out of bed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내일은 나을 거다, ⟪k:1⟫내일을 괜찮을 거라 되뇌었지만, ⟪k:2⟫결국 ⟪k:3⟫넬리는 침대에서 못 나오"
"는 상태가 됐어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_293DB283_1A79_43BB_940D_3FC08217DF56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cc1624cbf69939186943652ec2b50460d34cc35c9e12c933205d16d44e9a2cc
#. default-sha256: 6c257054d456d9c6facdcc5e23e149c08b846074476214df9384492e2d4746b8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_293DB283_1A79_43BB_940D_3FC08217DF56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ll make something you like. How about a nice, expensive chicken? ⟪k:1⟫The last one got "
"away, but I won’t let that happen this time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫넬리가 좋아하는 닭 요리를 ⟪k:1⟫내가 해 볼까? ⟪k:2⟫호화롭게 갈게. ⟪k:3⟫저번엔 놓쳤지만, ⟪k:4⟫"
"이번엔 괜찮을 거야."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7247EBBD_ACBB_4896_8C08_F41DDC4CD030
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b69f54e8e422c61f22fcc8650a76bfa6cc152930e3d14adda6a8191e752fd6ee
#. default-sha256: a7b026ea177c4d875d69d01a298ac0a78d698d7922b5ae7c3c291fec4d6078cb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7247EBBD_ACBB_4896_8C08_F41DDC4CD030"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t you worry, Mell...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’ll be better before you know it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫괜찮아, ⟪k:1⟫오라버니……. ⟪k:2⟫걱정 안 해도 ⟪k:3⟫금방 나을 거야……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B7FD887E_6647_4B33_8C5A_73F39F68D475
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4fd9ae3d97957c624927e82b0a198120dfcffca94fa60a2f41750b6c7be7d87
#. default-sha256: bd9dbb5ff6c13e52b811f4271301743154018e06ba6e898dfa6f2efb873edb15
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B7FD887E_6647_4B33_8C5A_73F39F68D475"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yeah. Yeah, you will...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ll be just fine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……응, ⟪k:1⟫그래……. ⟪k:2⟫……괜찮⟪k:3⟫겠지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7656D0B4_D829_4428_A94D_D0D75FFC0FC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92b63d2f05f539ad56cb50f08d174fea25995896f5a25dbf2a9096f51cd865cd
#. default-sha256: 5979f87ffa8497983142bb7b9e810ea150ef8162807b6e39e4379fac353651cc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7656D0B4_D829_4428_A94D_D0D75FFC0FC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s going to be back to normal soon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫우리 생활은…… ⟪k:1⟫더 ⟪k:2⟫안 바뀌겠지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e69ed2168ad029163937d19b0872c950fef7fce14de87b5615531458ca53116
#. default-sha256: 0219827daf92518595914ba0705c9bc81118a46e138413082d193f02570dd6ab
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I searched everywhere for some medicine that could cure her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Healthy foods, fruits "
"and vegetables with supposed medicinal properties—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫anything I could get my hands on."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래서 나는 ⟪k:1⟫필사적으로 약을 찾아다녔어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫몸에 좋다는 음식, ⟪k:4⟫과일을 ⟪k:5⟫닥치"
"는 대로 모으면서,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6956578F_0EA8_47FA_BEAD_3D9CE72F54C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ec09398aae7a81f127f1e8b7293d033d6f880b0a13e600ff6268ca0791e1c34
#. default-sha256: 67d587eafcbbbe80687532c98d0ecf3efa96ecbe6eef01c78565591188665711
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6956578F_0EA8_47FA_BEAD_3D9CE72F54C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was really doing it for myself..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫실은…… ⟪k:1⟫나를 위한 거였어……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f6ec48ecc5aac1ccd76bb121931f25f78261528dc5edc3ebd6d5a42c7855545
#. default-sha256: 0a8c6932ef508ef374657f30bcfc33d592a6eda55da1fde616706fb580e22b21
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would go to bed at night afraid I’d wake up the next morning...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and Nellie "
"wouldn’t."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아침에 ⟪k:1⟫넬리가 안 깨어나면 어떡할지…… 그 순간이 오진 않을지 조마조마했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c04cf9491ee54f84317140aeb7cccf084183ca2e0f744f992abe51339fb32a7
#. default-sha256: 8656ddd51b6251d15ee2226ae1dd2aef39e554c8158bf33447e599550a06add4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, I heard whispers—⟪k:1⟫whispers of a witch who lived by the lake."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럴 때 ⟪k:1⟫소문을 들었지. ⟪k:2⟫호숫가에 사는 마녀 소문을……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4e8790d452681659b4fb2b1b6c84b21bf42c5881a49007173b49ce3811c23bb
#. default-sha256: 617689594a116bee1f2eb680b1baa04350fda04f2659b9f34831c70b251d258a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing the thin trails of smoke rising from the chimney, I was convinced the rumors were "
"true. A witch lived in that house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫굴뚝에서 연기가 뭉게뭉게 나오는 걸 보고―― ⟪k:1⟫소문대로 ⟪k:2⟫마녀가 사는구나 싶었지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b285e303d9ea89bcc0eb34b4ac5b7adffc2c82b59e64bd91ee47dcffda103646
#. default-sha256: 5f571ad3e740961773da4d117741dfb2b1cacb63565c938de9ecda021b299768
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to expect. Being a recluse, I figured she wasn’t going to be very "
"sociable, at least. ⟪k:1⟫To tell you the truth, I was kind of scared to knock on her door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어떤 사람이 있는지 모르는 데다, ⟪k:1⟫속세에서 벗어났다니 깐깐하지 않을까 싶더라. ⟪k:2⟫솔직히 "
"⟪k:3⟫조금 겁이 났는데……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 341fedd52bc2190f83e96395091bd14f4eecaae59ba47e976afc9688fbfc88b1
#. default-sha256: bab52fe655c2ca62abb6a17b9c0965ceaf81c60e561e1d2ebec9df28f6afa78f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And even though she’d only said two words, there was something... ⟪k:1⟫indescribably "
"enchanting about that voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 뿐만 아니라―― ⟪k:1⟫단 한마디만 했는데, ⟪k:2⟫그 애의 목소리엔 홀릴 것 같은 힘이 있더라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99b18f11c702d99f5e789b82c9e641472b0a1ea934e557eb56a9eafd111d0238
#. default-sha256: 63c6b9353bc04020b087bda74c291bcadddaeb2a6f230f090f7e896da50c13c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Who’s there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……누구죠……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68d76364289cf19b092c9550a31563c848f65a7ae992ccb69efc0406a4e13df2
#. default-sha256: ff20a4796d6bce4e6adca4d4a6b6234974de7f5e2255628a5138bd47c16054e6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She repeated her question, which brought me back to reality, ⟪k:1⟫though I still had to "
"fight to maintain my wits enough to respond coherently."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 다시 그 질문을 듣고 ⟪k:1⟫퍼뜩 놀라서 ⟪k:2⟫그제야 대답했어. ⟪k:3⟫어떻게든 ⟪k:4⟫말이 잘 나"
"오도록 ⟪k:5⟫애쓰면서……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ae3868f7b273f34a01468dd6c6634a04ee0668aef6de2a089a8adb7bb4c9b28
#. default-sha256: 1f41f08d69a4438f7568cf5f08c1d02b35275677c2dae46d0b1169addfa1dfe0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫uh, ⟪k:2⟫she’s got an extremely high fever that won’t come down...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She has "
"no appetite—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she’s only drinking water—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫and she can’t get out of bed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫그게, ⟪k:2⟫열이 엄청 높은데요……. ⟪k:3⟫식욕도 없어서 ⟪k:4⟫유동식밖에 못 먹어요. ⟪k:5⟫"
"침대에서도 못 나오고요……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D1E81EE0_61A3_402A_BBA0_6E92397B5916
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90c65b7fc3fe6fc1821574da148692d4d98dcf0613cc45e262c26e6be7854201
#. default-sha256: 07b065b728b139f77d4e2eaa731b8eecaad5be0cc99a0706038b7177f9d0c300
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D1E81EE0_61A3_402A_BBA0_6E92397B5916"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫With a voice that pretty, she must be equally lovely, I thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫목소리가 이렇게 고우니 ⟪k:1⟫얼굴도 똑같이 ⟪k:2⟫아름다울 것만 같더라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_08B8138A_13B3_4743_83E1_8CB7CDBEDC94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89fcdd25b770063ae6cb64fd38a7ffcdefeabb7d16d752fa1d0923493433bf14
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_08B8138A_13B3_4743_83E1_8CB7CDBEDC94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_79712892_9343_4B71_A0BB_50F73D1F310E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0aa06b45f4b798b87d8a7ef1dda74c00d7715f46ccd27113a0281aa2104b73e4
#. default-sha256: 952bf5e59baf64ddfd8772d038246eb81bff7b8ae21da93707a1013a480d17cf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79712892_9343_4B71_A0BB_50F73D1F310E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through our conversations, I managed to learn her name, as well as the fact that she had "
"come here from a faraway country. ⟪k:1⟫We were both a long way from home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그때는 ⟪k:1⟫그 애 이름까지 듣는 데 성공했는데……,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 애도 먼 곳에서 왔는지 ⟪k:4⟫처지"
"가 비슷하게 느껴지더라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E2A036F1_5F1D_4E75_BFE8_F62D13021E14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c8e8afe021bea7ca5a0eaadb7da20f290138f9fbcd8c8fecd031a903bf136f3
#. default-sha256: 2b1bc3ec5c0a9abcee35f45477e7ea14da02e42ca92e743f44630dea2e8f2f1e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E2A036F1_5F1D_4E75_BFE8_F62D13021E14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...To my surprise, she accepted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――이런 식으로."

#: scenario8:scenario8_31622FA0_C332_4EC0_8D02_3F8EF5AECB7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fa7704e6a6dfdf2a536a5d03366dd770109b9bad2dff3eac12de40f01d07c60
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_31622FA0_C332_4EC0_8D02_3F8EF5AECB7D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FBBFEFF1_619A_4F88_8375_DE6C26E53BA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a874a0fd570d63d1b40085d28318819542f34735813e3ced9955c7a5bf41da65
#. default-sha256: ce34c5fe44cf39aea8d8677bdf30bdf08d4c448459965fbb8b74d87548cc8b80
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FBBFEFF1_619A_4F88_8375_DE6C26E53BA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m... ⟪k:2⟫in disbelief, to tell you the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫솔직히…… ⟪k:2⟫놀랐어요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3734CB1_2063_47D3_8025_51EC94F9889E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f329fd7c0eedee0323910f638a3cc6c0ccee6d231be5c3a900a20abd021e6bf
#. default-sha256: 6a02848e4fd5b7da9fb26d2613b1ab64801adb1c90eabbc875f54c4d5edf31a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3734CB1_2063_47D3_8025_51EC94F9889E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Huh? What for?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어? ⟪k:3⟫왜……?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C9F0D52C_DB44_4957_A2F9_A16B21400440
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f4b14edc9421ffdf3114e872af7a0c08b0af47b2d92d809c310fe28f88fac6a
#. default-sha256: 6c182bbb60ea959f39ad57f3a42f08882cdeeb9e790f093d48600967631d33d8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C9F0D52C_DB44_4957_A2F9_A16B21400440"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve seen my face. You know how hideous I am. And still you invited me on a walk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫제 얼굴은 보시다시피 추하니, ⟪k:2⟫그걸 알고도 ⟪k:3⟫산책을 나가잔 사람이 있을 줄은 상상"
"도 못 했거든요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B7F5FEEB_76EB_4BAD_8354_D3C2465B5BAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56c1fb148d00973a62dc9f77f581b458d7d5f3dc6558c3a8ce5238ecccfd685a
#. default-sha256: 69072a743d1414d77e472817df447e5ebd9f353539bb1abd3429456c1b64bffc
